-      <section anchor="artifact-groupings" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-3.5">
-        <name slugifiedName="name-artifact-groupings">Artifact Groupings</name>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-3.5-1">The previous sections discussed the bootstrapping artifacts, but only
-certain groupings of these artifacts make sense to return in the
