+|Device|                                              |  Server   |
++------+                                              +-----------+
+   |                                                        |
+   | 1.  "HTTPS" Request ("signed-data-preferred", nonce)   |
+   |------------------------------------------------------->|
+   | 2.  "HTTPS" Response (signed redirect information)     |
+   |<-------------------------------------------------------|
+   |                                                        |
+   |                                                        |
+   | 3.  HTTPS Request (os-name=xyz, os-version=123, etc.)  |
+   |------------------------------------------------------->|
+   | 4.  HTTPS Response (unsigned onboarding information    |
+   |<-------------------------------------------------------|
+   |                                                        |
 ]]></artwork>
